Update software on sd card:
sudo bmaptool copy --bmap oldschoolic-rpi4-debug-raspberrypi4-64.rootfs.wic.bmap oldschoolic-rpi4-debug-raspberrypi4-64.rootfs.wic.bz2 /dev/sdb


III. Mocked App
================
To run mocked app, run the following path:
1. run mocked silo-monitor-sensors-app: `./silo-monitor-sensors-app mocked`
2. `cd backend/files`
3. `source .venv/bin/activate`
4. `sudo ./.venv/bin/python3 ./flask-main.py`
5. `python3 -m http.server 8000`

To manually parse protobuf message, run the following command:
`sudo socat -u UNIX-CONNECT:/tmp/silo-monitor.sock STDOUT | dd ibs=1 skip=4 | protoc -I /home/oxfrd/moje/yocto/silo-monitor-image/silo-sensors-proto-msg/proto --decode=silo.MonitoringSnapshot snapshot.proto`